			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Complete PascalCase directory hierarchy migration\n\nFinalize the restructuring of the Cocoon source tree and build artifacts to enforce the strict PascalCase directory hierarchy. This commit moves all remaining flat-named files (e.g., `BaseConfig.js`, `Constant.js`, `TypeConverter.js`) into nested directories where every logical segment of the path becomes a distinct PascalCase folder (e.g., `Config/Base/Config.js`, `Constant/Environment/Constant.js`).\n\nUpdate ESBuild configuration imports, service interfaces, and the comprehensive VSCodeAPI handler suite to reflect the new file locations. Regenerate the `RouteManifest.ts` to include new Webview and Debug method counts, and update `README.md` documentation to link to the new paths. Regenerate all `Target/` build artifacts to ensure the compiled extension host bundle resolves imports correctly against the new structure.\n\nThis change completes the migration initiated in previous commits, ensuring consistent organization across the entire extension host codebase.",
			"SHA": "8e2bfa404f9a232ca9ca1c43feaecb0e5aaa22b4"
		},
